  ],
  "notes": "Image titled LILYGO T5-4.7-S3 Capacitive Touch Version E-Paper BOARD PINMAP (ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8, Screen-4.7-S3 V2.4). pi-header right-column label PO5_CTRL is printed with a 5 while the board silkscreen reads POS_CTRL; SCL(17)/SDA(18) kept as printed. Small board silkscreen in the inset (e.g. MSIO) is too low-resolution to transcribe reliably and was not added. Skipped: Data0-7, TF card, touch, RTC and E-paper STV/LE lists (internal, no positions), IO21/IO0/RST buttons, LEDs, battery JST-PH (Bat ADC IO14), USB-C, touch FPC."
